t("Arcane Combat", "Combate arcano", "talent name")
t("Arcane Cunning", "Astucia arcana", "talent name")
t("The user gains a bonus to Spellpower equal to %d%% of your Cunning (Current bonus: %d).", "El usuario ganas una bonificación a Spellpower igual a %d%% de su Astucia (Bonificación actual: %d ).", "tformat")
t("Arcane Feed", "Alimentación arcana", "talent name")
t("Regenerates %0.2f mana per turn, and increases physical and spell critical chance by %d%% while active.", "Regenera %0.2f mana per turno, y aumentas la probabilidad física y crítica de hechizo por %d %% mientras activa.", "tformat")
t("Arcane Destruction", "Arcano Destruction", "talent name")

t("Currently selected spell: %s", "Hechizo seleccionado actualmente: %s", "tformat")
t("Allows you to use melee weapons to focus your spells, granting a %d%% chance per melee attack to cast an offensive spell as a free action on the target.\n\t\tDelivering the spell this way will not trigger a spell cooldown.\n\t\tYou may select an allowed spell to trigger this way, or choose to have one randomly selected for each attack.\n\t\tWhile dual wielding or using a shield the chance is halved.\n\t\tThe chance increases with your Cunning.\n\n\t\tAllowed spells: %s %s", "Te permite usar armas cuerpo a cuerpo para enfocar tus hechizos, otorgando un %d%% de probabilidad por ataque cuerpo a cuerpo de lanzar un hechizo ofensivo como acción gratuita sobre el objetivo.\\n\\t\\tLanzar el hechizo de esta manera no provocará tiempo de reutilización.\\n\\t\\tLa probabilidad aumentará con tu Poder mágico.", "tformat")
t("Raw magical damage channels through the caster's weapon, increasing raw Physical Power by %d%% of your Magic (current bonus: %d).\n\t\tEach time you crit with a melee blow, you will unleash a radius %d ball of arcane damage, doing %0.2f.\n\t\tThe bonus scales with your Spellpower and talent level.\n\t\tIf you are using a shield this will only occur 50%% of the time.\n\t\tIf you are dual wielding this will only occur 50%% of the time.\n\t\tAt level 5 the ball becomes radius 2.", "El daño mágico crudo canaliza a través del arma del lanzador, aumentando el Poder Físico crudo en %d%% de tu Magia (bonificación actual: %d).\\n\\t\\tCada vez que canalizas un hechizo a través de tu arma, obtienes esta bonificación durante %d turnos.", "tformat")
